{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our character Lady Camara is a lady in her 30s who enjoys living her own life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the world is invaded by different aggressive species and our character cannot remain silent in the face of this situation and goes to their places alone and the adventure begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal in the single-player Lady Camara is to defeat the creatures and move on to the next section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need to open doors where necessary and continue on our way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its gigantic feature against gigantic creatures, it equalizes the situation and provides a comfortable fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a weapon system developed for close and distant attacks, this makes you superior to your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633910/extras/f9e8f211e7630cd56c709ac9fda12ccc.avif?t=1745910437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633910/extras/4ffde0b7d2573e859b8af0cfd603d761.avif?t=1745910437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633910/extras/a1a166d5bfc0e76b8d317701a067e5db.avif?t=1745910437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633910/extras/e1eced7edcabd4db2fa0e4c4052ed820.avif?t=1745910437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c